# Prolate-wave operator (PW_λ) eigenvalue-spectrum disk cache.
#
# The toolkit writes prolate spectra here as
# `<cwd>/data/prolate_eigvals_cache/` when a run computes (or
# remote-fetches) a spectrum. The generated `.json` / `.json.zip` files
# are gitignored (see /.gitignore); this `.gitkeep` keeps the directory
# structure in the repo so the layout is self-documenting and present
# on a fresh clone.
#
# Public consolidated fixtures live at:
#   https://github.com/TeamXcelerator/xcelerator-prolate-eigvals-cache
